WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.603
Watch and read: For your sentencebuild practice, choose the correct sentence about

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:05.704
Ama and rice.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.633
The answer is: Ama likes rice.. A sentence puts the subject and action in a clear

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:11.952
order.

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:17.339
Watch and read: For your composition practice, you use “Ama | is | happy” in a

00:00:17.339 --> 00:00:19.333
sentence table. What is the best answer?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:25.137
The answer is: Ama is happy.. Read the instruction carefully and choose the helpful

00:00:25.137 --> 00:00:26.195
or correct response.
